     2892         , output v-value-integer
     2893         , output v-value-logical
     2894         , output par-type
     2895         , input-output table thbjattr_thbj-attr
     2896         ) no-error .
     2897       for each thbjattr_thbj-attr
     2898       on error undo, return error return-value
     2899       :
     2900         case thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code :
     2901           when 'denstclc':U then do:
     2902             if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-value-type = 'character':U then do:
     2903               assign
