    14799            end.
    14800            else do:
    14801              wait-for go of frame d-in-line focus tt-fr-doc-line.fact-qnty.
    14802            end.
    14803          end.
    14804        end.
    14805      end case.
    14806   end.
    14807   run disable_ui in this-procedure.
