    16510                                    ub.doc-line-attr.gds-code  = buf_goods.gds-code      and
    16511                                    ub.doc-line-attr.attr-code = "type-inp-vat"                   no-error.
    16512     if not available ub.doc-line-attr and
    16513        STRING(tt-fr-doc-line.type-inp-vat) <> ?    and
    16514        STRING(tt-fr-doc-line.type-inp-vat) <> ""   then do:
